		(property "Note" "MUST be fitted. TIA stability needs Cf >= sqrt(Cin/(2*pi*Rf*GBW)); with ~100 pF of cable, Rf = 2M2 and the LMP7721's 17 MHz GBW that is ~0.65 pF, so 10 pF has wide margin (sets a 7.2 kHz / 159 Hz pole)."
